   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "205c95f22b",
   "es": "Para contar cómo estás: I have a cold (tengo un resfrío), I have a bad cough (tengo mucha tos), I have a pain in my back. Con el present perfect dices desde cuándo: I've had a cough for three days.",
   "kinds": [
    "lesson.intro"
   ]
  },
